{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495530,"name":"Aviv Yeshayav","username":"TheAviv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/theaviv/{size}/119258_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T01:21:59.062Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the Grok Bot desktop app’s agent chat, sending a message or replying under a thread sometimes shows the toast: “Message failed to send.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot, open an agent chat.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a normal message or reply under a thread.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApp shows toast: “Message failed to send.”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessage delivers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot provided (Grok Bot desktop app)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct: Grok Bot desktop app (agent chat)\u003cbr\u003e\nAccount: \u003ccode\u003eaviv@theaviv.ca\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen: Friday Sep 18, 2026 ~8:25 PM America/Toronto\u003cbr\u003e\nAgent: Ellis\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHappened in a short burst of messages around 8:25 PM Toronto. No Request ID on the toast.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso emailed \u003ccode\u003ehi@cursor.com\u003c/code\u003e (message/thread id 1a0b710c8e234f30) and CC \u003ccode\u003esupport@x.ai\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495530-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495530-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T10:10:48.613Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":20,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":101.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172314,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat","display_username":"Aviv Yeshayav","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135276,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat/172314/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":495532,"name":"Aviv Yeshayav","username":"TheAviv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/theaviv/{size}/119258_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T01:25:19.711Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eUpdate: The failed sends happened when I was sending a burst of messages into the agent chat at once. Looks like chat/send reliability breaks under message storm load, not a single-message failure.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T01:25:19.711Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172314,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat","display_username":"Aviv Yeshayav","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135276,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat/172314/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495636,"name":"Yas","username":"StupidYas","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/stupidyas/{size}/121449_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T09:11:49.672Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThe issue is still persisting on my end (going on for 3 days now).\u003cbr\u003e\nRather than a permanent downtime, it behaves like a flapping connection: the app keeps alternating between a working state and complete disconnection roughly every 10 to 15 minutes.\u003cbr\u003e\nSymptoms:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhen it drops, clicking “Check for Updates” immediately returns:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ccode\u003eCouldn't check for updates. Check your connection and try again.\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll outgoing prompts result in \u003ccode\u003eFailed to send\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAfter a few minutes, connectivity restores itself on its own, showing \u003ccode\u003eYou're up to date\u003c/code\u003e, and messages go through again—before dropping again shortly after.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnvironment details:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClient version: \u003ccode\u003e0.57.1\u003c/code\u003e (Stable track)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOS: macOS\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComputer status: \u003ccode\u003eYour computer is on the latest version\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnyone else experiencing this exact 10–15 min drop pattern?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T09:11:49.672Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172314,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat","display_username":"Yas","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138738,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat/172314/6","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495646,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T10:09:14.530Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/theaviv\"\u003e@TheAviv\u003c/a\u003e - what you hit that evening was a temporary issue on the service side that delivers messages to the Grok Bot. It’s been fixed. Messages sent during that short window didn’t go through, and only showed up as Failed to send when you reopened the app later. Anything sent after that is delivering normally, including your retries. No need to reset anything or reinstall. If you still see a message from that evening marked as failed, just hit Resend on it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/stupidyas\"\u003e@StupidYas\u003c/a\u003e - what you’re describing looks different. Drops every 10 to 15 minutes with alternating connected and disconnected states, plus \u003ccode\u003eCouldn't check for updates\u003c/code\u003e. That looks more like a network issue than the same incident, so let’s look at it separately. To avoid mixing two different cases in one thread, please start a separate thread for your case and include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAre you behind a corporate network, VPN, or proxy?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDoes the drop pattern still happen if you switch to another network, like a mobile hotspot?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRough time of the last drop, with your timezone.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith that, we can dig in further. Let me know if the issue comes back for either of you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T10:09:14.530Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":10.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172314,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat/172314/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495682,"name":"Yas","username":"StupidYas","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/stupidyas/{size}/121449_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T11:56:35.830Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/deanrie\"\u003e@deanrie\u003c/a\u003e — that pointed me in the right direction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI don’t see the issue on Android with the same account. On desktop, after switching networks the problems went away (Failed to send / “Couldn’t check for updates” / sync banner).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo this was on my network side, not a Grok Bot outage. Appreciate the help.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T11:56:35.830Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":7,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172314,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat","display_username":"Yas","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138738,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-message-failed-to-send-in-agent-chat/172314/9","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495708,"name":"Aviv Yeshayav","username":"TheAviv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/theaviv/{size}/119258_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T13:19:09.000Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/deanrie\"\u003e@deanrie\u003c/a\u003e. Confirmed on our side: sends after that evening window are delivering normally again. No reset or reinstall needed. Will Resend any leftover failed messages from that short window if they still show as failed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame report is also on ticket T-F96779.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"posts_count":7,"upda